# Allowlist: the image needs only these. Everything else (node_modules, .next,
# .git, .claude worktrees) would otherwise be sent on every build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
# Captcha solver checksums (Dockerfile) and the netlog sidecar script (Dockerfile.netlog).
!vendor/captcha-solver/
!scripts/netlog-capture
# Chromium image inputs (Dockerfile.chromium). The WebSocket guard ships inside src/.
!vendor/browser-assets/
!scripts/captcharaptor/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

# Invisible worker dependency locks.
!vendor/invisible/
